    (Intuitionistic.MP
      (Intuitionistic.S {(Imp (Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) a) Bottom)} {(Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) (Imp a Bottom))} {(Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) Bottom)})
