      (Intuitionistic.MP
        (Intuitionistic.S {(Imp (Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) a) Bottom)} {(Imp a Bottom)} {(Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) (Imp a Bottom))})
        (Intuitionistic.MP
          (Intuitionistic.K {(Imp (Imp a Bottom) (Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) (Imp a Bottom)))} {(Imp (Imp (Imp (Imp a Bottom) Bottom) a) Bottom)})
